      "subject": "fix(builder): dropped ZIPs reach the import modal, the top bar's mode and mark-all-read work, and workspace context types (MS-2026-0006)",
      "body": "Real bugs: the global drop zone called setImportOpen with the files as a second argument it does not take, so the import modal opened without them; the default mode was dev, which matches none of the top bar's modes, so none showed selected (now developer); the top bar's Mark all read called a context function that did not exist; and a Genesis artifact panel used as=section, which LuminaFlagshipCard renders as a button. Types: the workspace context exports ImportPrefill, SkillMode and Project, which files import from it, and types notifications; Project declares runtime and lastEditedAt, which every project carries; Genesis record types are re-exported where the panels import them; the type library is ES2021 for replaceAll (target unchanged). Exporting the context types surfaced 12 errors their absence had hidden, fixed here. 85 type errors remain; both UI contracts unchanged.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
